      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The domain **turtle.tech** is a highly brandable, memorable, and strategic digital asset that aligns perfectly with your business identity and long-term growth objectives in the technology and web3 ecosystem. Acquiring turtle.tech offers a unique opportunity to enhance brand protection, expand digital real estate, and secure a valuable domain in the thriving .tech top-level domain space."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
