      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Brand Cohesion:** Complements your existing flagship domain turtle.xyz, reinforcing brand unity across multiple TLDs."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Market Positioning:** Signals innovation and technical expertise, crucial for tech-centric platforms and decentralized finance projects."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**User Trust:** Short, easy to remember, and trustworthy domain facilitates user retention and recall."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-15",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Growth Enablement:** Provides flexibility for future product lines, sub-brands, or technology initiatives."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
